  "components": [
    {
      "text": "### Camunda Copilot",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "FormHeading",
      "layout": {
        "row": "row_0",
        "col": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "I am the Camunda Copilot, here to help with process modeling and automation.",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "Paragraph_intro",
      "layout": {
        "row": "row_1",
        "col": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Camunda is a process automation platform used to design, automate, and improve business processes from end-to-end. Key components include:",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "Paragraph_platform_desc",
      "layout": {
        "row": "row_2",
        "col": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "##### BPMN (Business Process Model and Notation)",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "Subheading_bpmn",
      "layout": {
        "row": "row_3",
        "col": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A graphical standard for modeling and executing business processes.",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "Paragraph_bpmn",
      "layout": {
        "row": "row_4",
        "col": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "##### DMN (Decision Model and Notation)",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "Subheading_dmn",
      "layout": {
        "row": "row_5",
        "col": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A standard for modeling and automating business decisions.",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "Paragraph_dmn",
      "layout": {
        "row": "row_6",
        "col": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "##### Forms",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "Subheading_forms",
      "layout": {
        "row": "row_7",
        "col": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A way to create user interfaces for human tasks within your processes.",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "Paragraph_forms",
      "layout": {
        "row": "row_8",
        "col": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "##### Process Orchestration",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "Subheading_orchestration",
      "layout": {
        "row": "row_9",
        "col": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ability to coordinate interactions between different systems, APIs, microservices, and people.",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "Paragraph_orchestration",
      "layout": {
        "row": "row_10",
        "col": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "How can I help you with BPMN, DMN, or designing a form today?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "BPMN Assistance",
          "value": "bpmn"
        },
        {
          "label": "DMN Assistance",
